<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan drains 100 bln yen from money market. [CORRECTED 01:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan drains 100 bln yen from money market. [CORRECTED 01:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 100 billion yen from the money market through an offering to sell 100 billion yen worth of commercial bills on Friday, money traders said.</p>
<p>(Corrects figure in headline from 200 bln yen to 100 bln yen)</p>
</text>
